      "updated": 1795294527691,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CheckNode -> PostChecker\n\n1. no post_to_channel call\n     -> no new messages\n2. message not in channel history\n     -> :x: feedback\n3. check_claims vs dataset\n     ok    -> :white_check_mark:\n     wrong -> delete message, :x:\n4. feedback as HumanMessage\n5. :x: count >= max_failed_checks\n     -> + AIMessage giving_up",
      "originalText": "CheckNode -> PostChecker\n\n1. no post_to_channel call\n     -> no new messages\n2. message not in channel history\n     -> :x: feedback\n3. check_claims vs dataset\n     ok    -> :white_check_mark:\n     wrong -> delete message, :x:\n4. feedback as HumanMessage\n5. :x: count >= max_failed_checks\n     -> + AIMessage giving_up",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
